WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In 1922, one writer asked people to repeat a sentence to themselves.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
He called it autosuggestion. His book also promised far more than he could prove.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Later researchers studied self-hypnosis, but not every study tested a recording.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Learning a skill and pressing play are different kinds of activity.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Zen12 sells a twelve-minute listening format. Its larger claims need separate evidence.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ask what was tested. Try a free listening comparison first.
